    maxPlayers: 9,
    routePath: 'scat',
    LLM: 'Game: Thirty-One (Scat). Cards: 3 per hand, 3 in widow. Target: 31 pts in one suit. Logic: Sum cards of same suit. Ace=11, Face=10, 2-10=value. Three-of-a-kind=30.5. End hand: Knock (one final turn for others) or Blitz (instant win with 31).',
    Player: "Welcome to Thirty-One! Exchange cards with the 'widow' to get as close to 31 points in one suit as possible. Aces are 11, face cards are 10. A set of three-of-a-kind is 30.5! Knock when you think you're ahead.",
    tagline: "Suit up to 31. Outwit the market. Don't be the last on the bus.",
